{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>近年升呢做人妻兼新手媽媽的陳嘉慧（Erica），產後一直專心照顧一對仔女，並不時於社交平台分享育兒日常。隨着開學季展開，陳嘉慧日前晒出一輯女兒返學的近照，感性記錄愛女漸漸獨立的成長時刻，引來大批網民關注。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_764e07dfe57b3525-2211\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>陳嘉慧貼出多張相片，可見小朋友身穿深藍色配白色領口的校服服飾，抱著大公仔，模樣極為可愛。其中一張照片，是陳嘉慧的老公抱著睡著的女兒，畫面十分溫馨。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_764e07dfe57b3525-2211\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9932aa37-295d-4289-b32e-d9bbc2ff9b36.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026EEqWP4Q4ux1789377259.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9932aa37-295d-4289-b32e-d9bbc2ff9b36.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9df2a6ec-6db2-421d-8563-18f5a2d696f8.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026LOZSd0OzpM1789377258.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9df2a6ec-6db2-421d-8563-18f5a2d696f8.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_764e07dfe57b3525-2212\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>陳嘉慧坦言女兒最初適應期時相當黏人，要緊緊捉住她並要她陪同入課室，捨不得她離開。不過轉眼間，女兒已經可以自己踏入校門，並主動揮手道別，令她讚嘆小朋友的成長來得太突然。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_764e07dfe57b3525-2213\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>她感嘆心裡既欣慰又有些不捨：「成長不單止屬於小朋友，也是媽媽學習放手嘅過程，希望你可以係校園盡情探索，每日都過得開開心心。」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T13:23:15.508712+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}